self.KB_CONTENT["card:758268"]={"id":"card:758268","ty":"card","sourceId":"758268","title":"『請購資料維護作業』中的『採購包裝數量 (TB035)』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"採購","keywords":["採購","庫存","大於","包裝"],"y":"other","answer":"* 此欄位必須大於等於零。* 可點選(icon)或[F2]庫存包裝量查詢。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
